      "writtenOn": "2019-06-21T09:55:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good catch, the test above is obsolete. Historically the code would do:\nstartCaptivePortalApp(Network) -\u003e [CS] check it\u0027s a portal -\u003e [CS] send intent\n\nNow it\u0027s:\nstartCaptivePortalApp(Network) -\u003e [CS] check it\u0027s a portal -\u003e [CS] call INetworkMonitor.launchCaptivePortalApp -\u003e [NM] call CM.startCaptivePortalApp(Network, Bundle) -\u003e [CS] send intent\n\nso the test above that does:\nmCm.startCaptivePortalApp(Network)\nexpectNoIntent\n... with a mocked NetworkStack always does nothing since CM.startCaptivePortalApp(Network, Bundle) is never called.\n\nUpdated test to change expectNoIntent -\u003e expect INetworkMonitor.launchCaptivePortalApp not called.\n\nThis is one of those things that needs to get better coverage via the new integration tests.",
